{
    "id": "demojameson.app.sub",
    "name": "DemoJameson 应用订阅",
    "description": "DemoJameson 的 BoxJs 订阅",
    "author": "@DemoJameson",
    "repo": "https://github.com/DemoJameson/TMDB-Proxy",
    "icon": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181192?v=4",
    "apps": [
        {
            "id": "demojameson_tmdb_proxy",
            "name": "TMDB 增强",
            "keys": [
                "@dj_tmdb_proxy_boxjs_configs.aliasFallback",
                "@dj_tmdb_proxy_boxjs_configs.characterTranslation",
                "@dj_tmdb_proxy_boxjs_configs.aggregateCredits",
                "@dj_tmdb_proxy_boxjs_configs.imageWebp",
                "@dj_tmdb_proxy_boxjs_configs.cacheBackend"
            ],
            "author": "@DemoJameson",
            "repo": "https://github.com/DemoJameson/TMDB-Proxy/tree/main/dist",
            "icons": [
                "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/homarr-labs/dashboard-icons/png/tmdb.png",
                "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/homarr-labs/dashboard-icons/png/tmdb.png"
            ],
            "settings": [
                {
                    "id": "@dj_tmdb_proxy_boxjs_configs.aliasFallback",
                    "name": "中文别名补全",
                    "val": true,
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "desc": "缺少中文标题时，使用中文别名替代"
                },
                {
                    "id": "@dj_tmdb_proxy_boxjs_configs.characterTranslation",
                    "name": "中文角色名",
                    "val": true,
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "desc": "使用豆瓣数据将演职员中的中文角色名"
                },
                {
                    "id": "@dj_tmdb_proxy_boxjs_configs.aggregateCredits",
                    "name": "聚合演职人员",
                    "val": true,
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "desc": "演职人员数据从主演改为整剧/整季演员"
                },
                {
                    "id": "@dj_tmdb_proxy_boxjs_configs.imageWebp",
                    "name": "WebP 图片",
                    "val": true,
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "desc": "请求 TMDB 图片时优先获取 WebP 格式，更省流量"
                },
                {
                    "id": "@dj_tmdb_proxy_boxjs_configs.cacheBackend",
                    "name": "缓存后端",
                    "val": "https://tmdb-proxy.demojameson.de5.net",
                    "type": "text",
                    "desc": "远端缓存地址，留空使用默认地址"
                }
            ],
            "descs_html": [
                "TMDB API 尽量补全中文标题、TV 演职员接口与角色名汉化，支持本地代理工具脚本和 Vercel/Workers 反向代理。",
                "点此直达 <a href=\"https://github.com/DemoJameson/TMDB-Proxy/tree/main/dist\">项目目录</a>",
                "Egern 安装：<a href=\"egern:/modules/new?name=TMDB%20Proxy&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FDemoJameson%2FTMDB-Proxy%2Fmain%2Fdist%2Ftmdb_proxy.plugin\">安装模块</a>",
                "Loon 安装：<a href=\"https://www.nsloon.com/openloon/import?plugin=https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FDemoJameson%2FTMDB-Proxy%2Fmain%2Fdist%2Ftmdb_proxy.plugin\">安装插件</a>",
                "Surge 安装：<a href=\"surge:///install-module?url=https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FDemoJameson%2FTMDB-Proxy%2Fmain%2Fdist%2Ftmdb_proxy.sgmodule\">安装模块</a>",
                "QX 安装：<a href=\"https://quantumult.app/x/open-app/add-resource?remote-resource=%7B%22rewrite_remote%22%3A%5B%22https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FDemoJameson%2FTMDB-Proxy%2Fmain%2Fdist%2Ftmdb_proxy.snippet%2C%20tag%3DTMDB%20Proxy%2C%20enabled%3Dtrue%22%5D%7D\">安装片段</a>",
                "脚本读取优先级：默认值 < BoxJs < 插件参数。已经在插件参数里填写的值会覆盖 BoxJs。"
            ]
        }
    ]
}
